        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1715922645161-2e8c7618f1ce?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3ODM2Nzk0MTB8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post U3-SDK" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;smartlydressedgamesu3-sdk&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/SmartlyDressedGames/U3-SDK&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;SmartlyDressedGames/U3-SDK&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;u3-sdk&#34;&gt;U3 SDK
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Source code for &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://smartlydressedgames.com/unturned/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Unturned&lt;/a&gt;, a free open-world zombie survival sandbox game.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;getting-started&#34;&gt;Getting Started
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Download/clone this repository&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://unity.com/download&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Unity Hub&lt;/a&gt; (required to install engine)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://unity.com/releases/editor/whats-new/2022.3.62f3&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Unity 2022.3.62f3&lt;/a&gt; editor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Optional&lt;/em&gt;: if making code changes, select &lt;strong&gt;Game development with Unity&lt;/strong&gt; + &lt;strong&gt;.NET desktop development&lt;/strong&gt; in the Visual Studio installer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Steam is running and you have &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://store.steampowered.com/app/304930/Unturned/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Unturned&lt;/a&gt; installed (large binary files and mods are loaded from here)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open the project with the Unity editor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open the &lt;code&gt;Assets/GameStartup.unity&lt;/code&gt; scene&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click play!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;resources&#34;&gt;Resources
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.smartlydressedgames.com/en/stable/u3-sdk/faq.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Frequently Asked Questions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://youtu.be/CqJnkcWfmEY&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Source Code Demo: Adding a Heat-Seeking Missile on YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.smartlydressedgames.com/en/stable/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Unturned&amp;rsquo;s Modding Documentation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
